{"id":"e1df6cfb55a11bcc","group":"56","path":"56/56-lem-levy-lifting.md","title":"Lévy提升的唯一性与前缀一致性","display":"lem-levy-lifting — Lévy提升的唯一性与前缀一致性","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-lem-levy-lifting","aliases":["56-lem-levy-lifting"],"display":"lem-levy-lifting — Lévy提升的唯一性与前缀一致性","depends_on":["[[56-df-levy-rule-lifting]]"],"source_section":"§8.4 Definitions 8.4.26,8.4.30,8.4.47; Exercises 8.4.31–32","source_printed_pages":"349–351,357","source_statement_status":"compared-to-local-djvu-ocr-and-selected-page-images; explicit-tag-coding-local","source_proof_status":"source-proof-read-and-local-derivation-in-Remark; not-machine-formalized"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-lem-levy-lifting"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-lem-levy-lifting</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-levy-lifting — Lévy提升的唯一性与前缀一致性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b2ae6f5d85c77f9b\" href=\"?note=b2ae6f5d85c77f9b\" title=\"56-df-levy-rule-lifting\">56-df-levy-rule-lifting</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§8.4 Definitions 8.4.26,8.4.30,8.4.47; Exercises 8.4.31–32"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"349–351,357"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"compared-to-local-djvu-ocr-and-selected-page-images; explicit-tag-coding-local"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source-proof-read-and-local-derivation-in-Remark; not-machine-formalized"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b2ae6f5d85c77f9b\" href=\"?note=b2ae6f5d85c77f9b\" title=\"56-df-levy-rule-lifting\">56-df-levy-rule-lifting</a> 的左线性TRS。单步断言的局部参数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\hat s\\in T_R^L\">\\(\\hat s\\in T_R^L\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u=(q,l,r)\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(\\operatorname{erase}_L(\\hat s))\">\\(u=(q,l,r)\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(\\operatorname{erase}_L(\\hat s))\\)</span>。路径断言独立取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\hat s,\\rho)\\in\\mathcal D_R^L\">\\((\\hat s,\\rho)\\in\\mathcal D_R^L\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\le\\ell(\\rho)\">\\(k\\le\\ell(\\rho)\\)</span>；拼接式另取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\\in\\mathcal F_R\">\\(\\eta\\in\\mathcal F_R\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{src}(\\eta)=\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho)\">\\(\\operatorname{src}(\\eta)=\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho)\\)</span>。红项擦除式的局部参数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(q,\\ell,h)\\in\\mathcal E_{R^L}\">\\((q,\\ell,h)\\in\\mathcal E_{R^L}\\)</span>；路径擦除式的局部参数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\langle\\hat s_i\\rangle_{i\\le n},\\langle\\hat u_i\\rangle_{i&lt;n})\\in\\mathcal F_{R^L}\">\\((\\langle\\hat s_i\\rangle_{i\\le n},\\langle\\hat u_i\\rangle_{i&lt;n})\\in\\mathcal F_{R^L}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{eraseOcc}_L(q,\\ell,h)\\coloneqq(q,\\operatorname{erase}_L(\\ell),\\operatorname{erase}_L(h)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{eraseOcc}_L(q,\\ell,h)\\coloneqq(q,\\operatorname{erase}_L(\\ell),\\operatorname{erase}_L(h)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{erasePath}_L(\\langle\\hat s_i\\rangle_{i\\le n},\\langle\\hat u_i\\rangle_{i&lt;n})\\coloneqq(\\langle\\operatorname{erase}_L(\\hat s_i)\\rangle_{i\\le n},\\langle\\operatorname{eraseOcc}_L(\\hat u_i)\\rangle_{i&lt;n}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{erasePath}_L(\\langle\\hat s_i\\rangle_{i\\le n},\\langle\\hat u_i\\rangle_{i&lt;n})\\coloneqq(\\langle\\operatorname{erase}_L(\\hat s_i)\\rangle_{i\\le n},\\langle\\operatorname{eraseOcc}_L(\\hat u_i)\\rangle_{i&lt;n}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LOcc}_R(\\hat s,u)\\in\\operatorname{Red}_{R^L}(\\hat s),\\qquad (\\hat s,\\operatorname{LOcc}_R(\\hat s,u),\\operatorname{LStep}_R(\\hat s,u))\\in\\operatorname{Step}_{R^L}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{LOcc}_R(\\hat s,u)\\in\\operatorname{Red}_{R^L}(\\hat s),\\qquad (\\hat s,\\operatorname{LOcc}_R(\\hat s,u),\\operatorname{LStep}_R(\\hat s,u))\\in\\operatorname{Step}_{R^L}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{eraseOcc}_L(\\operatorname{LOcc}_R(\\hat s,u))=u,\\qquad \\operatorname{erase}_L(\\operatorname{LStep}_R(\\hat s,u))=\\operatorname{ctr}_R(\\operatorname{erase}_L(\\hat s),u).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{eraseOcc}_L(\\operatorname{LOcc}_R(\\hat s,u))=u,\\qquad \\operatorname{erase}_L(\\operatorname{LStep}_R(\\hat s,u))=\\operatorname{ctr}_R(\\operatorname{erase}_L(\\hat s),u).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\hat u\\in\\operatorname{Red}_{R^L}(\\hat s)\\;\\left(\\operatorname{eraseOcc}_L(\\hat u)=u\\Rightarrow\\hat u=\\operatorname{LOcc}_R(\\hat s,u)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\hat u\\in\\operatorname{Red}_{R^L}(\\hat s)\\;\\left(\\operatorname{eraseOcc}_L(\\hat u)=u\\Rightarrow\\hat u=\\operatorname{LOcc}_R(\\hat s,u)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LPath}_R(\\hat s,\\rho)\\in\\mathcal F_{R^L},\\qquad \\operatorname{src}(\\operatorname{LPath}_R(\\hat s,\\rho))=\\hat s,\\qquad \\operatorname{erasePath}_L(\\operatorname{LPath}_R(\\hat s,\\rho))=\\rho.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{LPath}_R(\\hat s,\\rho)\\in\\mathcal F_{R^L},\\qquad \\operatorname{src}(\\operatorname{LPath}_R(\\hat s,\\rho))=\\hat s,\\qquad \\operatorname{erasePath}_L(\\operatorname{LPath}_R(\\hat s,\\rho))=\\rho.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\hat\\rho\\in\\{\\xi\\in\\mathcal F_{R^L}:\\operatorname{src}(\\xi)=\\hat s\\}\\;\\left(\\operatorname{erasePath}_L(\\hat\\rho)=\\rho\\Rightarrow\\hat\\rho=\\operatorname{LPath}_R(\\hat s,\\rho)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\hat\\rho\\in\\{\\xi\\in\\mathcal F_{R^L}:\\operatorname{src}(\\xi)=\\hat s\\}\\;\\left(\\operatorname{erasePath}_L(\\hat\\rho)=\\rho\\Rightarrow\\hat\\rho=\\operatorname{LPath}_R(\\hat s,\\rho)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LPath}_R(\\hat s,\\rho)|_k=\\operatorname{LPath}_R(\\hat s,\\rho|_k).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{LPath}_R(\\hat s,\\rho)|_k=\\operatorname{LPath}_R(\\hat s,\\rho|_k).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LPath}_R(\\hat s,\\rho;\\eta)=\\operatorname{LPath}_R(\\hat s,\\rho)\\mathbin{;}\\operatorname{LPath}_R(\\operatorname{tgt}(\\operatorname{LPath}_R(\\hat s,\\rho)),\\eta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{LPath}_R(\\hat s,\\rho;\\eta)=\\operatorname{LPath}_R(\\hat s,\\rho)\\mathbin{;}\\operatorname{LPath}_R(\\operatorname{tgt}(\\operatorname{LPath}_R(\\hat s,\\rho)),\\eta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>一步证明：抽出的Skel在每个左项函数位置与红项相同；每个变量位置由Match补齐，故带标源子项等于Skel·Match。LOut擦除为r，替换与擦除同态交换，给出合法带标步及原步。任何可擦除到u的带标规则必须有同样的规则项对λ，且其左项的每个函数位标签已经由源子项确定，故只有Skel这一左项，LOut随之唯一。左线性保证变量实例各自唯一。</p>\n<p>对步数归纳，得到有限路径存在、唯一及擦除相容；再按截断和拼接的长度归纳得到最后两式。前缀一致性也给出任意合法无限路径的唯一逐步提升：第i步通过其长度i+1前缀确定，不要求先为无限对象额外选择标签。这个结论只关于lifting，未使用FFD或needed正规化。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-levy-rule-lifting","status":"resolved","id":"b2ae6f5d85c77f9b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-levy-rule-lifting]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-levy-rule-lifting","status":"resolved","id":"b2ae6f5d85c77f9b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[56-df-levy-rule-lifting]] 的左线性TRS。单步断言的局部参数为 $\\hat s\\in T_R^L$、$u=(q,l,r)\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(\\operatorname{erase}_L(\\hat s))$。路径断言独立取 $(\\hat s,\\rho)\\in\\mathcal D_R^L$、$k\\in\\mathbb N$ 且 $k\\le\\ell(\\rho)$；拼接式另取 $\\eta\\in\\mathcal F_R$ 满足 $\\operatorname{src}(\\eta)=\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho)$。红项擦除式的局部参数为 $(q,\\ell,h)\\in\\mathcal E_{R^L}$；路径擦除式的局部参数为 $(\\langle\\hat s_i\\rangle_{i\\le n},\\langle\\hat u_i\\rangle_{i<n})\\in\\mathcal F_{R^L}$、$n\\in\\mathbb N$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\hat s\\in T_R^L","display":false},{"tex":"u=(q,l,r)\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(\\operatorname{erase}_L(\\hat s))","display":false},{"tex":"(\\hat s,\\rho)\\in\\mathcal D_R^L","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"k\\le\\ell(\\rho)","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta\\in\\mathcal F_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{src}(\\eta)=\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho)","display":false},{"tex":"(q,\\ell,h)\\in\\mathcal E_{R^L}","display":false},{"tex":"(\\langle\\hat s_i\\rangle_{i\\le n},\\langle\\hat u_i\\rangle_{i<n})\\in\\mathcal F_{R^L}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{eraseOcc}_L(q,\\ell,h)\\coloneqq(q,\\operatorname{erase}_L(\\ell),\\operatorname{erase}_L(h)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{erasePath}_L(\\langle\\hat s_i\\rangle_{i\\le n},\\langle\\hat u_i\\rangle_{i<n})\\coloneqq(\\langle\\operatorname{erase}_L(\\hat s_i)\\rangle_{i\\le n},\\langle\\operatorname{eraseOcc}_L(\\hat u_i)\\rangle_{i<n}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LOcc}_R(\\hat s,u)\\in\\operatorname{Red}_{R^L}(\\hat s),\\qquad (\\hat s,\\operatorname{LOcc}_R(\\hat s,u),\\operatorname{LStep}_R(\\hat s,u))\\in\\operatorname{Step}_{R^L}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{eraseOcc}_L(\\operatorname{LOcc}_R(\\hat s,u))=u,\\qquad \\operatorname{erase}_L(\\operatorname{LStep}_R(\\hat s,u))=\\operatorname{ctr}_R(\\operatorname{erase}_L(\\hat s),u).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\hat u\\in\\operatorname{Red}_{R^L}(\\hat s)\\;\\left(\\operatorname{eraseOcc}_L(\\hat u)=u\\Rightarrow\\hat u=\\operatorname{LOcc}_R(\\hat s,u)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LPath}_R(\\hat s,\\rho)\\in\\mathcal F_{R^L},\\qquad \\operatorname{src}(\\operatorname{LPath}_R(\\hat s,\\rho))=\\hat s,\\qquad \\operatorname{erasePath}_L(\\operatorname{LPath}_R(\\hat s,\\rho))=\\rho.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\hat\\rho\\in\\{\\xi\\in\\mathcal F_{R^L}:\\operatorname{src}(\\xi)=\\hat s\\}\\;\\left(\\operatorname{erasePath}_L(\\hat\\rho)=\\rho\\Rightarrow\\hat\\rho=\\operatorname{LPath}_R(\\hat s,\\rho)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LPath}_R(\\hat s,\\rho)|_k=\\operatorname{LPath}_R(\\hat s,\\rho|_k).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LPath}_R(\\hat s,\\rho;\\eta)=\\operatorname{LPath}_R(\\hat s,\\rho)\\mathbin{;}\\operatorname{LPath}_R(\\operatorname{tgt}(\\operatorname{LPath}_R(\\hat s,\\rho)),\\eta).","display":true}],"bytes":3578,"backlinks":[{"id":"803b6c844379847d","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用 [[56-df-levy-lifted-reduction]] 的左线性系统，$R^e$ 为边扩展规则，$T^e$ 为扩展项集。$\\boldsymbol s\\in T^{\\mathbb N}$、$\\boldsymbol u\\in\\mathcal E_R^{\\mathbb N}$ 满足 $\\operatorname{InfRed}_R(\\boldsymbol s,\\boldsymbol u)$，路径前缀、步及端点见 [[56-df-labelled-reduction]]。$\\pi_2(s,u,t)=u$ 为三元组的第二投影。$\\operatorname{EPath}_R$ 见 [[56-df-edge-expanded-reduction]]，标记提升的前缀一致性见 [[56-lem-levy-lifting]]；$\\mathcal I_{R^e}^{\\mathrm L}$ 是 [[56-df-levy-family-development]] 在扩展系统上的合法无限标记步接口。$\\operatorname{erase}_L,\\operatorname{LStep}_{R^e}$ 均取展开系统的Lévy实例。下面构造的函数仅在上述合法无限路径域上定义。"},{"id":"9618eeaafca311ce","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"使用 [[56-df-edge-expanded-reduction]] 的左线性系统、$\\mathcal E,R^e,\\mathcal C,\\operatorname{Exp},\\operatorname{Rep},\\operatorname{epos},\\operatorname{Vis}$。标记项、原子符号 $A$、复杂符号 $C$、子标签关系 $\\operatorname{SubLabel}$、擦除 $\\operatorname{erase}_L$ 见 [[56-df-levy-rule-lifting]]；路径提升及合法性见 [[56-lem-levy-lifting]]。这些标签构造以下均实例化于 $R^e$。$\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R$；$X\\in\\operatorname{Exp}(\\operatorname{src}(\\rho))$；$M\\in T_{R^e}^L$ 满足 $\\operatorname{erase}_L(M)=X$；$z\\in\\operatorname{Vis}(\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)),w\\in\\operatorname{Vis}(\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho))$；$i\\in\\mathbb N$。"},{"id":"4fc6d1a3bb083f0e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"使用 [[56-lem-levy-lifting]] 的标记、具体路径和目标接口。$x\\in V$，函数符号 $a,f,g,h,c$ 的元数分别为 $0,1,2,1,1$。下列 $R_1,R_2$ 分别实例化系统参数；$s=f(a)$，$t=c(a)$。$\\lambda,\\mu,\\nu,\\kappa$ 是Assertion定义的规则项对，$n\\in\\mathbb N$。$A(s,p)$ 作为零元标记符号时也记为相应零元项。"},{"id":"05ef806ab27a7169","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"使用 [[56-df-levy-proofterm-lifting]] 与 [[56-lem-levy-lifting]]。$\\phi,\\psi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R$ 共源，$\\hat s\\in T_R^L$ 满足 $\\operatorname{erase}_L(\\hat s)=S_R(\\phi)=S_R(\\psi)$。置换等价与具体路径证明项见 [[56-df-proofterm-permutation]]、[[56-df-proofterm-embedding]]。$\\rho,\\eta\\in\\mathcal F_R$ 共源，且 $\\operatorname{erase}_L(\\hat s)=\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)=\\operatorname{src}(\\eta)$。"},{"id":"bf70fb8b21c593c4","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用 [[56-df-levy-rule-lifting]] 的左线性系统，并假设 $\\forall(l,r)\\in R\\;(r\\notin V)$。$\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R$；$\\hat s\\in T_R^L$ 满足 $\\operatorname{erase}_L(\\hat s)=s=\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)$。$p\\in\\operatorname{PosF}(s)$，$q\\in\\operatorname{PosF}(\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho))$。$\\operatorname{Tr},\\operatorname{wit}$ 见 [[56-df-proofterm-traces]]、[[56-df-proofterm-embedding]]。$\\hat t=\\operatorname{tgt}(\\operatorname{LPath}_R(\\hat s,\\rho))$，$\\hat t_0=\\operatorname{tgt}(\\operatorname{LPath}_R(\\rho))$。此处 $V(p)$ 是有类型顶点构造器，非变量集。路径提升的存在唯一性与擦除相容性见 [[56-lem-levy-lifting]]。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-150","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-lem-levy-lifting.md]]"}],"outgoing":["b2ae6f5d85c77f9b"]}